{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026vYnyLXQEPb1794533551.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在內蒙古的草原上，有一間迷你「博物館」，展出多項展品。</p><p></p><p>在內蒙古錫林郭勒盟草原上，這個4.5平方米的蒙古包，其實是由一對牧民夫婦打造的「時光博物館」，裡面陳列著煤油燈、老式電視機、水壺等過百件舊物。「館長」說，每一件物品都帶有難忘記憶。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.NMG.MUSEUM.1030-1113-1_CLEAN 3.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026w543IlaSlS1794533999.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>錫林郭勒盟西烏珠穆沁旗牧民娜仁其其格說：「90年代生活比較困難，我媽媽撿了牛糞、賣了錢，給我買了這個夾子。這是80年代的，我小時候可愛騎這個自行車。那時候，這個(煤油燈)每家差不多只有1個。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"PICTURE J.NMG.MUSEUM.1030-1113-1_CLEAN 2.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026b2v4yrkRxa1794534009.png?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>別人眼中無用的舊報紙，她亦視若珍寶。她希望讓更多人見到這些有紀念價值的物品，了解草原人民的生活變遷。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:23:50.983534+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":266,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T01:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T07:21:57.280004+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T02:17:14.570903+00:00","content_hash":"fda4b1a50a8598334e92f05f0d40ed7196db84cf45dcf86dd5965343c1f640cf","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T02:23:50.983534+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}